</div><p class="eyebrow bp10-review-tag">COMPARE WITH CONFIDENCE</p><h2 id="phones-reviews-heading">Reviews &amp; Comparisons</h2><p class="bp10-review-deck">Equipment, coverage, real-world speeds, safety and long-term value—grounded in verifiable evidence.</p></header>
      <div class="bp10-compare-layout">
        <div class="bp10-compare-copy"><h3>What would you compare?</h3><p>Start with the connectivity category. Product-specific scorecards and interactive comparison tools are being developed; they are not yet live.</p>
          <div class="bp10-journey-cards bp10-journey-cards-three">
            <a class="bp10-journey-card bp10-phones-card" href="/internet/reviews/step-1/?category=internet"><span class="bp11-card-image"><img src={asset('reviews-internet.png')} alt="Home internet comparison illustration" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></span><span class="bp10-card-copy"><strong>Home Internet</strong><small>Compare providers, connection types, plans, speed, reliability and total service cost.</small><b>Begin at Step 1 →</b></span></a>
            <a class="bp10-journey-card bp10-tablets-card" href="/internet/reviews/step-1/?category=wifi"><span class="bp11-card-image"><img src={asset('wifi-mesh.png')} alt="Wi-Fi and mesh comparison illustration" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></span><span class="bp10-card-copy"><strong>Wi-Fi &amp; Mesh</strong><small>Compare routers, mesh systems, coverage, backhaul and equipment suitability.</small><b>Begin at Step 1 →</b></span></a>
            <a class="bp10-journey-card bp10-both-card" href="/internet/reviews/step-1/?category=both"><span class="bp11-card-image"><img src={asset('internetcompare.png')} alt="Home internet and Wi-Fi complete package comparison" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></span><span class="bp10-card-copy"><strong>Both Internet &amp; Wi-Fi</strong><small>Choose the home internet service and Wi-Fi equipment together as one complete package.</small><b>Begin at Step 1 →</b></span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="bp12-five-steps"><h4>Our planned evidence workflow</h4><ol><li><strong>Route</strong><span>Identify an internet-service or home-Wi-Fi decision.</span></li><li><strong>Needs</strong><span>House size, connected devices, security and budget.</span></li><li><strong>Evidence</strong><span>Published specifications, independent tests and support information.</span></li><li><strong>Compare</strong><span>Evaluate performance, limits and whole-life costs.</span></li><li><strong>Verdict</strong><span>Explain trade-offs and suitability without invented scores.</span></li></ol></div>
        </div>
        <figure class="bp10-product-visual"><img class="net-framework-image" src={asset('internetcompare.png')} alt="Internet and Wi-Fi equipment comparison concept" loading="lazy"/></figure>
      </div>
      <p class="net-review-framework"><strong>How ONOCRA compares:</strong> We examine official specifications, independent research, everyday usability and long-term value. Our recommendations explain the evidence, limitations and trade-offs clearly.</p>
      <div class="rv8-evaluation" id="onocra-evaluation">
        <div class="rv8-eval-heading"><img src="/phones/brand/faviconsignature.png" alt="ONOCRA O. signature" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Our Evaluation Approach</h3><p>We evaluate published evidence &amp; we do not claim to operate a test laboratory.</p></div></div><a class="bp10-methodology-link net53-method-link" href="/phones/reviews/methodology/">See current ONOCRA methodology →</a>
        <div class="rv8-eval-item"><img class="net53-eval-illustration" src="/phones/everydayuse.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div><strong>Everyday Use</strong><small>Coverage, reliability and household setup.</small></div></div>
        <div class="rv8-eval-item"><img class="net53-eval-illustration" src="/phones/technicalperformance.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div><strong>Technical Evidence</strong><small>Throughput, latency, backhaul and support.</small></div></div>
        <div class="rv8-eval-item"><img class="net53-eval-illustration" src="/phones/vfm.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div><strong>Value for Money</strong><small>Costs, features, software and suitability.</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv8-sources"><div class="rv8-sources-title"><h3>Our Sources &amp; Standards</h3><p>Official product documents, published testing and relevant public guidance are separate forms of evidence.</p></div><div class="net53-source-item"><span class="net53-source-art" data-net53-art><span class="net53-source-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">Wi-Fi</span><img src="/internet/sources/wifi-alliance.png" alt="Wi-Fi Alliance" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.classList.add('is-missing')"/></span><strong>Wi-Fi Alliance</strong><small>Wi-Fi standards and certification</small></div><div class="net53-source-item"><span class="net53-source-art" data-net53-art><span class="net53-source-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">FCC</span><img src="/internet/sources/fcc.png" alt="FCC" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.classList.add('is-missing')"/></span><strong>FCC</strong><small>US connectivity information</small></div><div class="net53-source-item"><span class="net53-source-art" data-net53-art><span class="net53-source-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">Ofcom</span><img src="/internet/sources/ofcom.png" alt="Ofcom" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.classList.add('is-missing')"/></span><strong>Ofcom</strong><small>UK broadband guidance</small></div><div class="net54-source-document"><span class="net54-document-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="net54-doc-leaf" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fcefb2"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#be9345"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x="14" y="9" width="36" height="46" rx="6" fill="url(#net54-doc-leaf)" stroke="#8a672c" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M23 22h18M23 30h18M23 38h13" stroke="#3b674e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="44" cy="45" r="9" fill="#226b51" stroke="#fff9e9" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m40 